# Store and push credentials. The Google Play service-account key can publish to the
# Play listing and the Firebase file identifies the FCM sender, so neither may reach
# this repository — it is public. The Play key should live OUTSIDE the repo entirely
# (see apps/mobile/eas.json); these patterns are defence in depth, not the plan.
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
play-store-key.json
api-*-*.json
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

